OHOS: uses the honest capture-exclusion fallback above, and expands/probes
the user-chosen recording directory for actual write access before
recording starts, prompting the user to re-pick rather than silently writing
into an unauthorized shared directory. The explicit automation path keeps
its existing path constraints unchanged.

